5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited for our trip! I want to make sure we have a great time. I'll look into the all-in rates against meals bought separately and the inn mealtimes and room arrangements!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to be clear about the total expenses. I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses let whole and the all-in rates against meals bought separately.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to make sure we all feel comfortable and connected this year. I'll look into the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I'll look into the ferry sailings and train time, as well as getting around by train and bus. I want to see how the logistics actually shape the trip.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
