60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm voting for B! The city break sounds like the most fun, and it's the fairest way to handle the money since we can just pay for what we actually use!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I'll vote for B as well. It offers the most transparency regarding costs, and as we discussed, it avoids the rigid structures and financial uncertainties of the other options.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'll vote for B too. It seems like the best way to ensure we have a healthy balance of shared time and personal space, so no one feels overwhelmed or lonely.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"I'll vote for B. It is the only option that doesn't waste our limited time on restrictive transport schedules, allowing us to actually enjoy the trip rather than just managing the travel.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for B too. It's the only one where I feel like I can actually relax and get some proper sleep. Thank you for understanding.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,Yay! We all agree! I can't wait to explore the city with everyone and find some cool shops!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
